      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُوَيْجَآءُ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاجَةٌ</span>, in two places: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْجَآءُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  You say also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُذْ حُوَيْجَآءَ مِنَ الأَرْضِ</span>
<i>Take thou a different and winding road of the
land.</i> (K.)

